# Tech Spec §3: Next.js talks to Laravel over HTTP, never accesses PostgreSQL directly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Local host-based routing dev (Tech Spec §6.1) — matches src/middleware.ts.
# Root domain resolves from Host header; no env var needed to switch marketing/
# dashboard/storefront/admin, just the hostname you request with (see README).
